<title>USA: CCC says sells 9.47 mln bushels corn from catalog.</title>
<headline>CCC says sells 9.47 mln bushels corn from catalog.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department off Agriculture said it sold a total of 9,466,196 bushels of corn and 71,671 bushels of barley at this week's catalog sale.</p>
<p>The CCC reported the following breakdown.</p>
